   994 				; Reg1/Reg2 = running row_offset (16-bit, row*MENU_ATTR_ROW_BYTES from
   995 				; MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM's start), advanced by MENU_ATTR_ROW_BYTES each row.
   996 				; Ptr_Lo/Hi = this band's 8-byte value table (Menu_Demo_Attr_Cols order).
   997 				; The column loop counter lives in X, not Y: vbsta/vblda clobber Y on every
   998 				; call in __VBXE_AUTO__ mode (vbxe_min.asm), and this loop calls vbsta once
   999 				; per column, so Y cannot survive across it.  Clobbers A/X/Y/Reg1-8.
