   866 				;=============================================================================
   867 				; Selector status line (row 20) - the highlighted image's description (typed
   868 				; in the converter, default = source filename without extension; up to
   869 				; NFO_NAME_CAP = 75 chars).  Reading a file per row stuttered a fresh
   870 				; directory, so instead the converter writes all the descriptions once into
   871 				; "IMAGES.LST" (8-byte key + description per record) beside the images.  Nfo_Name_LoadManifest slurps that in one pass on every
   872 				; Rescan_Images into NFO_NAME_VRAM (NFO_NAME_SLOT bytes/ordinal); the draw path
   873 				; is then a pure VRAM read.  No IMAGES.LST -> every slot stays $00 -> the line
   874 				; is simply blank.
   875 				;=============================================================================
   876
   877 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   878 				; Nfo_Name_ClearCache - blitter-wipe NFO_NAME_VRAM to $00 (every slot "no
   879 				; name").  Kicks BLT_NFO_NAME_CLEAR and waits (Nfo_Name_LoadManifest fills
   880 				; after).
   881 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   882 52B7			Nfo_Name_ClearCache
   883 52B7 A9 D2			lda #BLT_NFO_NAME_CLEAR-BLT_CLEAR
