  1153 				; Nfo_Name_Match - the 8-byte key at Nfo_Name_Line in.  Linear-scans the *.V1K
  1154 				; group of the name list (rows FileStart .. ImageCount-1) in IMAGE_BANK for a
  1155 				; byte-exact match.  Returns A = ordinal (row - FileStart), C=0 on a hit;
  1156 				; C=1 and A undefined if none.  Maps + unmaps IMAGE_BANK itself.
  1157 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
